    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1159">

                <pb facs="1175" n="1009" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg1009"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.516/160</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            French Ambassador
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1810</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-02-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 8, 1917</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the
                    receipt of your excellency’s note of January 25,<anchor n="2" xml:id="d1159-f1"
                    /> 1917, in further relation to the reported action of the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">de facto</hi> Government of Mexico in violating the
                    property rights of banking institutions in Mexico, and particularly the property
                    rights of the National Bank of Mexico and the Bank of London and Mexico.</p>
                <p>In reply I have the honor to refer your excellency to my note of February 7,
                    1917, in which I informed you that this Government has instructed its
                    representative near General Carranza to make an appropriate protest in the
                    premises.</p>
                <p>Accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
